| **No rate‑limiting / throttling** | The /health endpoint could be hammered, leaking internal state or contributing to a DoS. | Low–Medium |
| **No error handling** | Unhandled errors will leak stack traces and crash/unstably restart the app. | Medium |
| **No CORS policy** | The API is open to any origin; if CSRF protection is needed later, the lack of CORS can cause issues. | Low–Medium |
| **No request logging / audit** | Hard to detect suspicious activity. | Low–Medium |
| **Minimal dependency hygiene** | The code imports only Express – but other modules (e.g., a DB layer) will soon be added. Ensuring safe versions is critical. | N/A (future) |

