## 3. Concrete Security Recommendations

Below I’ve grouped the suggestions by concern and followed each with a concrete code example you could drop into `app.js` (or refactor into separate modules).  If you plan to keep the current simple structure, you can skip the parts that are not relevant to your workflow.

