## 8. Basic **HTTPS enforcement** (when behind a reverse proxy / load balancer)

If you own the deployment environment, configure the reverse proxy (NGINX/Traefik/Kong) to terminate TLS. Inside Express you can ensure requests **force HTTPS** (when behind a proxy):

```js
app.enable('trust proxy');                // trust X-Forwarded-* headers
