Add a simple error handler at the end of the middleware stack:

```js
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err.stack);          // Log stack trace to console
  res.status(500).json({ error: 'Internal server error' });
});
```

This keeps stack traces out of the response body in production while still providing visibility.

