| **Broken privilege checks** | If models expose admin endpoints without role checks, any user can perform privileged actions. | Centralised role/permission middleware. |
| **Credentials exposed in code** | Hard‑coded secrets in config files. | Use environment variables, secrets manager, or Docker secrets. |

**Code Example – JWT middleware:**
```js
const jwt = require('jsonwebtoken');

function requireAuth(req, res, next) {
  const authHeader = req.headers['authorization'];
  if (!authHeader) return res.sendStatus(401);
  const token = authHeader.split(' ')[1];
  jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET, (err, user) => {
    if (err) return res.sendStatus(403);
    req.user = user;
    next();
